{"lyrics":"[Intro]\n[00:01.00]Uh\n[00:01.68]Bitch, I'm— (Uh-huh, uh-huh)\n[00:02.54]Yeah (Uh-huh, uh-huh)\n[00:04.44]Yeah, uh, uh-huh\n[00:05.80]Yeah, uh, uh-huh\n[00:07.18]Yeah, uh, uh-huh\n[00:08.04]I just popped a 30, bitch (Uh-huh, uh, uh-huh, uh-huh)\n[00:10.32]You heard it (Uh)\n[00:10.78]A-215, uh\n[Verse 1]\n[00:11.72]All I know is rockstar and murder shit, yeah (Yeah, yeah, yeah, yeah)\n[00:14.06]Kill a cop and take the confiscated Actavis, yeah (Yeah, yeah, yeah, yeah)\n[00:17.00]Catch an opp and show his son what a bastard is, yeah (Slatt, slatt, slatt, slatt)\n[00:19.62]Give me head, baby, I'm your new psychiatrist, yeah (Let's go)\n[00:22.48]Tryna beef with No Limit? Show you what a riot is, yeah (Bitch)\n[00:24.94]Just bought a suppressor for this Glock, let's do a silent hit, yeah (Grrah, grrah, bitch)\n[00:27.96]Busting off these Percs, I'm high, I'm where Orion is, yeah (Okay)\n[00:30.72]I used to sell that work, I had your momma buying it, yeah (Okay)\n[00:33.40]This off the top of the dizzome, nigga, I don't ever be rippin' no writtens, yeah (Okay)\n[00:36.22]I got my hand on the chrizzome, I don't got time to be fightin' no nigga, yeah (Uh-uh)\n[00:38.96]Touchdown, I'm in the end zone, uh\n[00:40.28]15K on a Saint Laurent fur coat (Uh-huh)\n[00:41.44]Bad lil' bitch say she from Merlot (Uh-uh)\n[00:42.82]No, you can't try on my fur coat (Uh-uh)\n[Verse 2]\n[00:43.76]I'ma fuck her friend, I'ma wreck her friend, yeah, yeah\n[00:47.04]I'm Nelly with this gun, bitch, it's gettin' hot in here\n[00:49.90]R. Kelly to these rappers, niggas catching piss in here\n[00:52.66]I shot him in front of his bitch, she was screaming out, \"Oh, dear\"\n[00:55.46]Baby, your nigga a deer in my headlights (Uh, ayy, yeah)\n[00:58.04]DaBaby said it best, \"Bitch, I'm a boss, feel like Suge Knight\"\n[01:00.58]Take money from these White folks, then I take a nigga life (Yeah)\n[01:03.46]If he get in the way of the cash, then that nigga finna die (Oh, yeah)\n[01:06.60]I may hit a kickback to catch a vibe, oh, yeah (Yeah)\n[01:09.16]But if they try me in that bitch, I'm uppin' the fire, oh, yeah (Grrah, grrah, grrah)\n[01:12.02]Rick James Glock, Fire and Desire in here\n[01:14.74]Bitch, I'm Rick James, I'm gettin' higher and higher in here\n[01:17.56]Do this for the gang, we ain't selling crack this year\n[01:20.12]Yes, I mean brack, I can hear the slimes in my ear\n[Interlude]\n[01:25.06]Slatt, slatt, slatt, shoutout all my slatts (Ayy, Mr. GDK, bitch)\n[01:26.90]I got the rap game in a motherfuckin' headlock, bro (GDK, GDK, GDK, GDK)\n[01:28.36]My album went number one album in weeks, folk (GDK, GDK, GDK, GDK)\n[01:29.94]Just told the motherfucker, \"Suck my dick,\" to the whole world\n[01:31.98]Suck my dick, like suck it (NLMB, you know that's where the shit at)\n[01:34.08]Like, don't be afraid to suck it, you know what I'm sayin'?\n[01:35.58]I know it's big or whatever, just put it, put in your mouth and suck it (Ooh, you know what I'm sayin'?)\n[01:38.30]Yeah, bitch, yeah\n[Verse 3]\n[01:39.60]Perc' just kicked in, bitch, I feel right (Okay)\n[01:42.28]I'm 'bout to do a wheelie down the street on my dirt bike (Skrrt, skrrt, skrrt, skrrt)\n[01:44.72]My nigga Max don't believe I'm poppin' wheelies, alright (Skrrt, skrrt, skrrt, skrrt, that's crazy)\n[01:47.84]I'ma Meek Mill the shit out this bitch for the one time (Skrrt, Meek Milli)\n[01:51.50]Speed racer on the KTM, yeah (Oh yeah)\n[01:53.06]Two-fifty C's, somebody come raise my RPMs\n[01:55.38]I'ma tell you what I'ma do to my opps when I meet them\n[01:58.40]I know you heard the name Posto (Grrah), I'm gon' make them meet him\n[02:01.12]Fuck the opps\n[02:01.52]This song called \"No Limit Oh Dear,\" bitch, the end is near (Oh yeah)\n[02:04.08]Extended on my Glock, if I was in Africa, I would have extended spears, yeah (Oh yeah)\n[02:07.02]Y'all don't want no smoke, you don't want the cancer here (Yeah, cancer here)\n[02:10.30]My nigga Kyro wanna box, I'ma Mike Tyson him (Baow, baow, baow, baow, baow, baow)\n[Outro]\n[02:12.90]Yeah, I got the rap-game on motherfuckin' lock, man\n[02:14.72]This shit too motherfuckin' easy (Left, right, left, right, left, right)\n[02:17.30]Death Race for Love doing fuckin' crazy-brazy-ass numbers\n[02:20.38]Kyro, I know, when you hear this, bro (Hadouken! Hahaha)\n[02:22.22]Just know I got the paws for your ass (Uh)\n[02:23.38]Nigga, left-right, left-right, left-right, nigga (Slatt, slatt, slatt, slatt, slatt, let's go)\n[02:26.14]Mayweather, Pacquiao (Slatt, slatt, slatt, slatt, slatt, let's go)\n[02:27.76]Uh, uh, uh, what's the niggas name?\n[02:28.64]Cassius Clay, all that shit, nigga, hahaha (Bitch, yeah, yeah, yeah, yeah)\n[02:34.38]Yeah, yeah, Perc' bussin', yeah, yeah, yeah\n[02:40.78]Bitch!","words":[[1.0,1.08,"Uh"],[1.68,1.82,"Bitch,"],[1.88,1.94,"I'm—"],[1.98,2.08,"(Uh-huh,"],[2.34,2.5,"uh-huh)"],[2.54,2.72,"Yeah"],[3.1,3.76,"(Uh-huh,"],[3.8,3.98,"uh-huh)"],[4.44,4.58,"Yeah,"],[4.62,4.76,"uh,"],[4.82,5.26,"uh-huh"],[5.8,5.96,"Yeah,"],[6.02,6.14,"uh,"],[6.2,6.64,"uh-huh"],[7.18,7.56,"Yeah,"],[7.68,7.72,"uh,"],[7.76,8.0,"uh-huh"],[8.04,8.04,"I"],[8.2,8.38,"just"],[8.56,8.74,"popped"],[8.96,8.96,"a"],[8.98,9.1,"30,"],[9.16,9.24,"bitch"],[9.28,9.44,"(Uh-huh,"],[9.48,9.62,"uh,"],[9.9,10.04,"uh-huh,"],[10.12,10.28,"uh-huh)"],[10.32,10.38,"You"],[10.44,10.54,"heard"],[10.58,10.6,"it"],[10.66,10.72,"(Uh)"],[10.78,10.78,"A-215,"],[10.98,11.02,"uh"],[11.72,11.82,"All"],[11.94,11.94,"I"],[12.0,12.2,"know"],[12.24,12.3,"is"],[12.38,12.92,"rockstar"],[12.96,13.0,"and"],[13.04,13.28,"murder"],[13.34,13.4,"shit,"],[13.44,13.52,"yeah"],[13.56,13.62,"(Yeah,"],[13.66,13.72,"yeah,"],[13.76,13.9,"yeah,"],[13.94,14.0,"yeah)"],[14.06,14.22,"Kill"],[14.26,14.26,"a"],[14.36,14.6,"cop"],[14.66,14.72,"and"],[14.76,14.9,"take"],[14.94,14.98,"the"],[15.08,15.8,"confiscated"],[15.88,16.28,"Actavis,"],[16.32,16.4,"yeah"],[16.5,16.66,"(Yeah,"],[16.7,16.76,"yeah,"],[16.8,16.86,"yeah,"],[16.9,16.96,"yeah)"],[17.0,17.08,"Catch"],[17